        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Female Tourist\"]   I know what you mean. Like, you're selling finballs, why do you have a big knife on the counter there?",
        "type": "dialog",
