        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   I'm sure it's got nothing to do with that 'Resting Triad Face' you've got going on.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "I'm sure it's got nothing to do with that 'Resting Triad Face' you've got going on."
